    200  36f2							; OFF. VIBRATO or GLIDE held turns on what's off (the ADVANCED SOUND values;
    201  36f2							; a held VIBRATO has no delay); TAPE WOBBLE held: a deep slow vibrato, each
    202  36f2							; voice its own phase; WIDE held: the detune about twice as wide.
