    236  6252							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    237  6252							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    238  6252							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    239  6252							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
